#: desktop.cpp:66
msgid ""
"<h1>Multiple Desktops</h1>In this module, you can configure how many virtual "
"desktops you want and how these should be labeled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Sermaseyên Pirhêl</h1> Di vê modulê de tu dikarî diyar bikî ka çend "
"sermaseyên nîgaşî hebin."

#: desktop.cpp:78
msgid "N&umber of desktops: "
msgstr "&Hejmara sermaseyan: "

#: desktop.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Here you can set how many virtual desktops you want on your KDE desktop. "
"Move the slider to change the value."
msgstr ""
"Li virê dikarî diyar bikî ka li ser Sermaseya te ya KDE'yê çend sermaseyên "
"nîgaşî hebin. Ji bo guherandina nirx sirgûyê bikişîne."

#: desktop.cpp:94
msgid "Desktop &Names"
msgstr "&Navên Sermaseyan"

#: desktop.cpp:99
#, kde-format
msgid "Desktop %1:"
msgstr "Sermaseya %1:"

#: desktop.cpp:102 desktop.cpp:103
#, kde-format
msgid "Here you can enter the name for desktop %1"
msgstr "Li vir tu dikarî navê sermaseya %1 binivîsî"

#: desktop.cpp:117
msgid "Mouse wheel over desktop background switches desktop"
msgstr "Dema ku bangêra mişkî li ser rûerdê bigerînî, dê sermase biguhere"

#: desktop.cpp:244 desktop.cpp:268
#, kde-format
msgid "Desktop %1"
msgstr "Sermaseya %1"
